      "content": "idk i feel like i know my body better than a phone call does lol. like if the dose is too low it's not even really working if i'm still feeling dizzy like this. if i just took an extra one tonight it'll probably just stabilize me faster. isn't it better to just get the right level in my system so i don't have to keep dealing with this? what's the worst that happens if i just try it once?",
